data: {"id": "90fe76d6954f4adc-final", "run_id": "90fe76d6954f4adc", "seq": 2828, "ts_ms": 1788771851585, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，容器未启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (fact-bdf37966c24d) | 直接指出挂载失败的具体原因是 ConfigMap 资源缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubelet | `volume: \"input\"`, `container.waiting_reason: \"ContainerCreating\"` (fact-555d9dadb03e) | 证实容器因卷挂载问题卡在启动阶段，处于等待状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubelet | Pod Spec 中 `container: \"app\"` 的资源配置：Request CPU `5m` / Memory `8Mi` (fact-4a8d11d818e9, fact-70d573719df1) | 提供 Pod 调度与资源上下文，排除资源配额导致调度的嫌疑 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，`reason: \"ContainerCreating\"` (fact-ae286078c1a8) | 监控侧数据印证 K8s 状态，确认异常持续且未被自动恢复 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 0 (fact-4c693795b0f2) | 确认容器尚未成功启动过，排除了运行后崩溃重启的可能性 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#1）明确指出了失败机制是 ConfigMap 查找失败，这是导致 Pod 滞留于 `Pending/ContainerCreating` 状态（#2, #4）的根本物理原因。Metric 数据（#4, #5）从独立监控通道佐证了该状态，并确认了无重启计数，说明 Pod 始终未能完成生命周期中的容器启动步骤。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 定义引用不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' → Kubelet 挂载卷逻辑报错 (FailedMount) → 容器启动流程被阻塞 → Pod 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：Pod 定义配置错误。**\n\nPod Spec 中定义的卷 `input` 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。这一配置错误导致 Kubelet 在执行挂载操作时无法找到目标资源，触发 `FailedMount` 事件（证据 #1）。由于挂载是容器启动的前置必要条件，挂载持续失败导致容器进程从未被拉起，从而造成 Pod 长期停留在 `Pending` 或 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 #2, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 54.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 50.8s (Evidence 43.6s, RCA 7.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 114.084, "metrics": {"run_id": "90fe76d6954f4adc", "mttr": {"value": "1.9m", "seconds": 114.09012532234192, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 114090.12532234192, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 109197.0419883728, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 12999.102115631104, "to